          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
          <div class="feature-check-icon rounded-circle bg-violet-subtle text-violet p-2 mt-1">
            <i class="bi bi-magic fs-6 fw-bold"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="h6 fw-bold mb-1 text-dark">Smart Skill Compatibility</h4>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Match percentages help you focus effort on roles where you have the highest likelihood of winning.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
          <div class="feature-check-icon rounded-circle bg-emerald-subtle text-success p-2 mt-1">
            <i class="bi bi-clock-history fs-6 fw-bold"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
