            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Connect directly with vetted industry leaders, startups, and academic foundations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-6">
          <div class="feature-card p-4 rounded-4 bg-white shadow-sm border border-light-subtle h-100 transition-hover">
            <div class="feature-card-icon rounded-3 bg-violet text-white mb-3 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 48px; height: 48px;">
              <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow fs-5"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Resume Strength Meter</h3>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Actionable checklist tips help you complete your profile and attract recruiter eyes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-6">
          <div class="feature-card p-4 rounded-4 bg-white shadow-sm border border-light-subtle h-100 transition-hover">
            <div class="feature-card-icon rounded-3 bg-emerald text-white mb-3 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 48px; height: 48px;">
              <i class="bi bi-currency-dollar fs-5"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Fair Stipends &amp; Grants</h3>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Transparent pay rates and scholarship amounts clearly displayed on every card.</p>
